Wyoming veterans museum capital 25LSO-0190, 1.0
construction.
FISCAL NOTE
This bill contains an appropriation of $5,000,000 from the WYOMING TOURISM
ACCOUNT to the State Construction Department. This appropriation is effective
immediately.
This bill contains an appropriation of $25,000 from the GENERAL FUND to the
Legislative Service Office. This appropriation is effective immediately.
This bill contains an appropriation of $25,000 from the GENERAL FUND to the
Governor's Office. This appropriation is effective immediately.
DETAIL OF APPROPRIATION
Agency #: 027 Agency Name: State Construction Department
Unit: (new) Veterans Museum
EXPENDITURE BY SERIES AND YEAR FY 2025 FY 2026 FY 2027
0700 Capital Expenditures $1,250,000 $2,500,000 $1,250,000
Total Expenditure Per Year: $1,250,000 $2,500,000 $1,250,000
Grand Total Expenditure: $5,000,000
Total Appropriated to Agency: $5,000,000
Total Appropriated by Fund:
WYOMING TOURISM ACCOUNT $5,000,000
Description of appropriation:
The appropriation to the State Construction Department will be expended from the
0700 series (capital expenditures). As this is a phased project, the expenditure
of the appropriation is assumed to be 25 percent in year 1, 50 percent in year 2
and 25 percent in year 3. Actual expenditure of the appropriation may vary from
projections as the project progresses.
